    "detailed_description": "Let's play with &quot;Repairny&quot; AI robot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003970/extras/3d5dcba931711ec8e37a3d70549cb510.avif?t=1663897795\" /></div><br><br>&quot;Repairny&quot; is First-person perspective action game.<br><br>Repairny and drones are constantly attacking to player with light sword or laser gun.<br>Control player direction to guard with player's light sword.<br>Then attack with your light sword.<br><br>Destroy all of enemy in field to clear stage.<br><br>3 types of difficulty EASY / NORMAL / HARD (HARD mode will be unlocked if you complete NORMAL mode)<br>20 stages each mode<br>limited time is only 120 sec. <br>It may be a short time stress relief.<br><br>- How to Play -<br><br>It's simple and easy to play.<br>This game need mouse controller and space key and [A] [D] key on keyboard.<br>if XBOX controller is connected, it need to use Left joystick, shoulder L R, and [X] button.  <br> <br>Drag gray object bottom of window to control player direction.<br>Guard enemy's attack with your weapon light sword.<br><br>After guarded enemy Repairny's attack,  Repairny stopped momentary.<br>It's chance to attack for player.<br>Press space key or [X] button to attack.<br><br>Change player position with pushing [A] or [D] key. or shoulder L R on controller. Player can dodge enemy's attack and stay advanced position. <br><br>Normal Game Mode   : Destroy all of enemy in limited time and life.<br>Score Challenge Mode : Challenge to get high score within limited time. Your score is recorded to our web server a while.",
